# PRES-LIGHT -- W5-PRES R-104 acceptance: ALL03 at night (Ambient 0.5, Level
# 0.035, blue tint). Light above 1.0 brightens (the lamp posts' pools, MUL
# pass) instead of clamping; raised objects take their height light.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL03U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat view_building INYELWLAMP 3
wait 2
shot night-lamps
cheat view_building CAWASH01
wait 2
shot night-whitehouse
end
